WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.070 line:95%,end
Hi, my name is Johan Rydberg and I work at Embrace Safety.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:11.370 line:95%,end
We help municipalities do systematic crime prevention work,

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.100 line:95%,end
with a system support we call Embrace –

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.810 line:95%,end
so they can prevent the crime and insecurity they identify,

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:23.990 line:95%,end
and document the measures in our system, Embrace.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:30.220 line:95%,end
We are now part of PubliX Group, and the reason we chose to join

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:36.580 line:95%,end
was that already when we were contacted, we felt great trust in

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:41.280 line:95%,end
this buyer. That they were serious, that they treated us with respect,

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:47.300 line:95%,end
that they asked good, reasonable questions and really listened to our answers.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:57.460 line:95%,end
We also felt they were trying to build a group of companies that all serve society.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:02.720 line:95%,end
Then we felt we were entering a context with our crime prevention work,

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:08.380 line:95%,end
where we could get good synergies with the other companies –

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:11.740 line:95%,end
they have similar customers, really.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:18.940 line:95%,end
Our plan for the coming years is to strengthen our market position in Sweden.

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:23.420 line:95%,end
We are market leaders today, but we see great potential to grow

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:26.780 line:95%,end
and really become dominant in Sweden.

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:30.570 line:95%,end
I think PubliX will be a good partner for us here.

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:35.130 line:95%,end
They are well along the AI journey, and we have examples from other companies

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:38.190 line:95%,end
in the group where they have made important progress.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.750 line:95%,end
We are actually here today at an AI hackathon,

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.810 line:95%,end
where PubliX has gathered all the companies.

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:53.050 line:95%,end
And it's not just us, but basically all employees trying to

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:55.110 line:95%,end
build something new together.

00:01:55.870 --> 00:02:01.120 line:95%,end
This is just one example of how PubliX can help us forward on the AI journey.
